{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : (shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i) ∨ shape(v_1, i) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, i) = 1) ∧ ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2)
>>
Rule 2 (input tensor should have int or float dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_1) ∧ dtype_(v_1) ≤ 9
