>>
Rule 10 (if the dimension of tensor is greater than 2, all the dimensions should be greater than 0)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 2 then ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 11 (If one of the input is of type float16, other should be float type.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if dtype_(v_1) = 6 then (dtype_(v_2) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_2) = 8) else if dtype_(v_2) = 6 then (dtype_(v_1) = 6 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 7 ∨ dtype_(v_1) = 8)
